  <title>Learning Outcomes</title>
  <introduction><p>The official Number learning outcomes describe what you are expected to understand and be able to demonstrate across this entire strand. These are curriculum outcomes, not the shorter lesson-by-lesson Learning Intentions.</p></introduction>
